OL,3,GNEWSAMarried couple both world champion
OL,4,Apole climbers
OL,5,
OL,6,FSome couples might spend their free
OL,7,Ftime running, cycling or swimming
OL,8,Ftogether, or perhaps just going to the
OL,9,Fpub or the cinema if they are feeling
OL,10,Fmore sedentary.
OL,12,FBut Dan and Emma Whelan have taken
OL,13,Ftheir shared interest to new heights.
OL,14,F80ft (24.3m) high, to be exact.
OL,16,FThe couple, from Shropshire, are both
OL,17,Fworld champions in pole climbing, which
OL,18,Finvolves racing to the top of towering
OL,19,Ffir poles using specially modified
OL,20,Fspiked shoes and a climbing strop.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,355,350,200,160,0,100
