OL,3,GNEWSAMarried couple both world champion
OL,4,Apole climbers
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis week, Dan won his fifth
OL,7,Fconsecutive world championship at
OL,8,FRagley Hall, near Alcester in
OL,9,FWarwickshire, while Emma won her second
OL,10,Ftitle.
